  "final_message": "Done. Backend `backend/app.py` (Flask + SQLite in `data/weather.db`: Bearer-token auth, seeded reports for 6 cities, case-insensitive unique cities, paged listings, lookup recording, PUT clears omitted optionals, validation errors as 400 `{\"error\": ...}`); frontend in `frontend/src` (React/TS, Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`) with auth forms, city search card + \"No weather data for \u2026\", \u00b0C/\u00b0F switch, clickable 5 recent lookups, and signed-in report management with API validation messages and confirm-on-delete.\n\nVerified end-to-end against a gunicorn run mirroring the Dockerfile: all endpoints, 401/404/409/400 cases, SPA serving, and persistence across restarts; `npm ci` + `tsc --noEmit` + `vite build` all pass cleanly.",
